{"seq":14,"trial_id":"harness-zero-select-2026-11/zero-full-no-tool-search-opus-none-mu-v03-dev/sy-01-quarrendon-ticket-numbers/r4","wall_ts":"2026-11-05T22:00:02.343Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:10:00-05:00","args_digest":"d76fe28b4a23f37345bad1290ab9f044272048186248a088595be69e11edaf92","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"DHARNES0001","text":"I found two ticket numbers for Quarrendon Freight Lines in Moss's notes:\n\n1. **#PD-4492**, from *Moss: Sunday prep for Ruth* (teams/team-north/digests/2025-10-05-north-sunday.md). Thea Ramaswell logged it on 4 Oct 2025. Drivers checking in at Dock Doors 14–18 in the Eau Claire yard weren't getting SMS bay assignments. Support patched it that evening, and Thea confirmed on 5 Oct that it was working. The action list also mentions the same ticket: archive the kiosk logs before the 14 Oct 2025 maintenance window.\n2. **#4419**, from *Moss: North cheat sheet (undated)* (teams/team-north/digests/north-account-cheatsheet.md). Thea logged it because the gatehouse barcode scanners at Door 14 weren't reading trailer tags on third shift. It was moved up to tier-2 support for firmware testing. This note has no date.\n\nNotes:\n- I looked through all six of Moss's notes that are open to everyone: four for North and two for Central. Quarrendon also comes up in the 9/14/2025 pipeline digest and the 3/23/2026 renewal check-in, but neither gives a ticket number.\n- The Central notes list tickets #4409 and #4412, but those belong to Pree's dealer account, not Quarrendon.\n- Marcus has a note on \"Quarendon Freightways.\" That's a different company and not one of our customers, so I left it out."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"DHARNES0001","ts":"1791987000.000124"}}
